# SentinelX SIEM frontend configuration (Vite).
# Copy to `.env` or `.env.local` for local overrides. These files are
# git-ignored. Only VITE_-prefixed variables are exposed to the browser, and
# they are embedded into the public build — NEVER put secrets here.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Base origin of the backend API.
#
# Development: leave this UNSET. API requests then use the relative "/api" path,
# which the Vite dev server proxies to the local backend (see vite.config.ts).
#
# Production (Vercel): set this to the Railway backend origin. Do NOT include a
# trailing "/api" — the API client appends it. Example:
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-backend.up.railway.app
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-backend.up.railway.app
